OL,3,GNEWSAI grew up in care without a role
OL,4,Amodel - it's inspired me to help the
OL,5,Anext generation
OL,6,
OL,7,FA 19-year-old who struggled to get back
OL,8,Fon his feet after losing his job at a
OL,9,Ffast food outlet says he is inspired to
OL,10,Fgive looked-after children the role
OL,11,Fmodel they need.
OL,13,FJamie, who spent time in care, said
OL,14,Fsigning on to Universal Credit was a
OL,15,Ftough time, but after getting a place
OL,16,Fon an intensive employability scheme
OL,17,Frun by a charity, he secured a new job
OL,18,Fwhich he is due to begin soon.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
