OL,3,GNEWSAI grew up in care without a role
OL,4,Amodel - it's inspired me to help the
OL,5,Anext generation
OL,6,
OL,7,FAs the UK government publishes a review
OL,8,Finto reducing the numbers of young
OL,9,Fpeople not in work, education or
OL,10,Ftraining, Jamie said the extra support
OL,11,Fhe got helped him with his mental
OL,12,Fhealth and his work ethic.
OL,14,FHis long-term ambition is to work with
OL,15,Fchildren to give them what he did not
OL,16,Fhave.
